a amenaza y hacer más daño.", "More hit chance: key to holding threat and dealing more damage.", "Icy Veins" }, ["Shield Specialization"] = { "Recuperas maná al bloquear; ayuda con los altos costos de maná.", "Returns mana when you block, helping with Protection's heavy mana costs.", "Icy Veins" }, ["Holy Conduit"] = { "Mantienes Consecration más tiempo sin quedarte sin maná.", "Keeps Consecration up longer without running out of mana.", "Icy Veins" }, ["Improved Seal of Fury"] = { "Más maná de vuelta para mantener Consecration más tiempo.", "More mana returns so you can keep Consecration up longer.", "Icy Veins" }, ["Improved Righteous Fury"] = { "Más defensa: elige esto o One-Handed Weapon Specialization según lo que necesite tu grupo.", "More defense: pick this or One-Handed Weapon Specialization depending on your group.", "Wowhead" }, ["One-Handed Weapon Specialization"] = { "Cerca de 1 % más de daño por punto en mazmorra.", "About 1% more damage per point in dungeons.", "Wowhead" }, ["Templar's Bulwark"] = { "Nuevo cooldown que te hace casi inmortal durante 8 s.", "New cooldown that makes you nearly immortal for 8 s.", "Wowhead" } },
