ntes.", "Gives an on-demand root that has no diminishing returns.", "Icy Veins" }, ["Predator's Edge"] = { "Aumenta el daño extra de tus críticos.", "Further increases the bonus damage your crits deal.", "Icy Veins" }, ["Counterattack"] = { "Parte de tu prioridad cuerpo a cuerpo, tras Mongoose Bite y Strider Kick.", "Part of your melee priority, after Mongoose Bite and Strider Kick.", "Wowhead" }, ["Strider Kick"] = { "Siempre disponible: te deja jugar Hunter cuerpo a cuerpo mucho mejor.", "Always available: makes melee Hunter far more effective.", "Wowhead" } },
