 Veins" }, ["Arcane Concentration"] = { "Mejora la eficiencia en combate (gastas menos Mana).", "Improves combat efficiency.", "Icy Veins" }, ["Arcane Blast"] = { "Sube de forma notable el daño a un solo objetivo.", "Provides measurable upticks in single-target damage.", "Icy Veins" }, ["Improved Channeling"] = { "Calidad de vida casi obligatoria.", "A quality-of-life must-have.", "Icy Veins" }, ["Arcane Geometry"] = { "Pelea más eficiente.", "More efficient combat.", "Icy Veins" }, ["Missile Barrage"] = { "Arcane Blast es tu golpe principal y activa Missile Barrage.", "Arcane Blast is your main spell and procs Missile Barrage.", "Icy Veins" }, ["Arcane Resilience"] = { "Pelea más eficiente.", "More efficient combat.", "Icy Veins" }, ["Arcane Meditation"] = { "Recuperas mucho maná en combate: menos espera entre peleas.", "Lots of Mana regen in combat: less downtime between fights.", "Icy Veins" } },
