 hechizos fallan mucho menos.", "Your spells miss much less often.", "Icy Veins" }, ["Improved Starfire"] = { "Reduce el tiempo de lanzamiento de Starfire.", "Reduces Starfire's cast time.", "Wowhead" }, ["Eclipse"] = { "El talento que define la rotación si lanzas hechizos largos.", "The rotation-defining talent for a hard-casting playstyle.", "Wowhead" } },
